---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Become an associate auditor | Eurocert Asia"
  description="Find out what to discuss when enquiring about associate auditor opportunities with Eurocert Asia."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/post/become-associate/"
>
  <main>
    <section class="bg-[#030a16] py-20 text-center text-white">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
        <p class="mb-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-eurogold-400">Careers</p>
        <h1 class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-3xl font-bold md:text-5xl">Become an associate auditor</h1>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-white/70">Information for professionals interested in discussing possible associate auditor work.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white py-16">
      <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl space-y-6 px-6 text-slate-700">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Enquire about current requirements</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Associate auditor requirements depend on the standard or scheme, the industry sector and the scope of any available work. Professionals can contact Eurocert Asia with a current CV, relevant qualifications, audit experience and the standards for which they hold competence. The team can then confirm whether there is a suitable current opportunity and explain the applicable assessment process.
        </p>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Selection or an enquiry does not guarantee training, authorisation, assignments or a particular level of income. Any engagement is subject to competence review, impartiality checks, availability and written terms. Auditors must disclose potential conflicts and must not consult for organisations they assess for certification.
        </p>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Before accepting work, clarify the assignment scope, travel, scheduling, fees and expenses, confidentiality obligations, reporting requirements and how audit findings are reviewed. Keep personal and client information secure, and follow the applicable audit procedures.
        </p>
        <a class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-euro-600 px-7 py-3 font-semibold text-white hover:bg-euro-700" href="/contact/">Contact Eurocert Asia</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
